menu "ESP-Sim"

config ESPSIM_TZ
    string "Time zone (POSIX TZ)"
    default "UTC0"
    help
        The pod reports its activation date and time in this zone, as a
        real pod reports the PDM's local time. Example: "CST6CDT,M3.2.0,M11.1.0".

config ESPSIM_AP_SSID_PREFIX
    string "Access point name prefix"
    default "ESP-Sim-Pod"
    help
        With no Wi-Fi network saved, the board runs an access point named
        this plus the end of its MAC address. Its password is printed on the
        serial console at boot.

choice ESPSIM_MEDTRUM_MODEL
    prompt "Default Medtrum model"
    default ESPSIM_MEDTRUM_200
    help
        The base serial a fresh Medtrum simulation starts with. The control
        panel can pivot it later without a rebuild.

config ESPSIM_MEDTRUM_200
    bool "200U (serial 4A12D828)"

config ESPSIM_MEDTRUM_300
    bool "300U (serial 52DF1614)"

endchoice

endmenu
